{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792893950.9, "seq": 4, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00060664, "parents": ["seed"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"], ["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 2, "editable": ["s1", "s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 523, "out": 1000, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 5.2, "stop": "end_turn"}, "genes_changed": ["s3"], "genes_added": [], "genes_removed": [], "added_sizes": [], "lines_changed": 2, "keeps_added": [], "pruned": []}, "error": null, "fingerprint": null, "birth": 2, "accepted": true, "name": "Z2", "species": "S0"}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792893952.6, "seq": 6, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00061194, "parents": ["Z1"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 491, "out": 1017, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 5.2, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation changes only `progress`. A step now counts as progress only if it closes distance to the goals after subtracting a penalty for each enemy within 2 tiles of the destination. The existing `score` rule, which gates MOVE on `progress > 0`, is unchanged, so the bot should stop walking into enemy clusters en route to goals while still advancing when the path is clear.\n\n```python\n@gene(\"s4\", \"distance closed toward goals, minus a penalty for enemies near the step\", parents=[\"s4\"])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    closed = at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)\n    near_enemies = count(1 for u in enemies() if dist(u.pos, t) <= 2)\n    return closed * 2 - 3 * near_enemies\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 48: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 2, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792893954.2, "seq": 5, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.0006775399999999999, "parents": ["seed"], "log": {"edges": [["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 297, "out": 1187, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 6.9, "stop": "end_turn"}, "genes_changed": ["s3"], "genes_added": ["Z5a"], "genes_removed": [], "added_sizes": [3], "lines_changed": 5, "keeps_added": ["GOAL_FIELD"], "pruned": []}, "error": null, "fingerprint": null, "birth": 3, "accepted": true, "name": "Z3", "species": "S1"}
{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792893956.7, "seq": 7, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.00065094, "parents": ["Z1"], "log": {"edges": [["score", "progress", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s1", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 491, "out": 1095, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 5.8, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "The change: `progress` now refuses steps that bring a low-health champion within 4 tiles of an enemy champion. `score` then scales MOVE by how far the step gets us toward the goals, so longer approaches rank higher.\n\n```python\n@gene(\"s4\", \"how much closer a step brings me to the goals; refuses steps into enemy champions when hurt\", parents=[\"s4\"])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    p = at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t)\n    if me().health_frac < 0.4 and count(1 for u in enemies() if u.is_champion and dist(u.pos, t) <= 4) > 0:\n        return -1\n    return p\n\n\n@gene(\"s1\", \"value of doing this option now\", parents=[\"s1\"])\ndef score(o: Option) -> Num:\n    if o.kind == PICK:\n        return 1\n    if o.kind == BUY:\n        return 100 if o.item == 6 else 0\n    if o.kind == RECALL:\n        return 90 if me().health_frac < 0.35 else 0\n    if o.kind == ATTACK:\n        if o.unit.is_champion:\n            return 80\n        return 60 if gems() == 0 else 0\n    if o.kind == TRIBUTE:\n        return 70\n    if o.kind == MOVE:\n        pr = progress(o.tile)\n        return 50 + 10 * pr if pr > 0 else 0\n    return 0\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 49: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 3, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
