{"arena": "Z", "t": 1792894146.7, "seq": 58, "op": "mutate", "model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "cost": 0.0006096399999999999, "parents": ["Z6"], "log": {"edges": [["progress", "goal_field", "call"]], "n_edges": 1, "editable": ["s3", "s4"], "llm": {"in": 398, "out": 1031, "cache_read": 5434, "cache_write": 0, "seconds": 5.2, "stop": "end_turn"}, "reply": "This mutation changes `progress` only. It adds a penalty for stepping within 2 tiles of a visible enemy, so the bot is less likely to walk into fights on the way to a goal. `goal_field` is left as it is, since rebuilding the field per pass would cost more fuel.\n\n```python\n@gene('s4', 'goal progress; penalizes allied-occupied tiles and tiles within 2 of enemies', parents=['s4'])\ndef progress(t: Tile) -> Num:\n    if t in ally_tiles():\n        return -100\n    danger = count(1 for u in enemies() if dist(u.pos, t) <= 2)\n    return at(goal_field(), me().pos) - at(goal_field(), t) - 3 * danger\n```"}, "error": "GenomeError: progress line 45: expected Bool, got Num", "birth": 23, "accepted": false, "fingerprint": null}
